{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act48side_level_act48side_03_end","storyGroup":"act48side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act48side_level_act48side_03_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"ME-3","storyName":"无解的谜题","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"能否成为负责人尚需投票，本以为十拿九稳的缇缇终于意识到，萨尔贡过去的侵略在米诺斯人心中留下的仇恨，仅凭真心与热情无法消弭。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act48side/level_act48side_03_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act48side_03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["醉酒的工匠","清醒的工匠","？？？","缇缇","卡珊卓拉","帕拉斯","里底娅","佩里安德洛斯","颓丧的男人","米奥"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","duration":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_bg_69_g9_templetheater_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":9},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2072_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"仁爱又英勇的建国英雄克瑞斯拉，哪怕是夜晚也无法抹去您身上的辉光。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"是您庇护第一神殿的工匠，带来两位智者，替我们排忧解难，替您修建殿堂。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"虫鸣代替您手中的竖琴作响，头冠由后人编织出胜利的形状，而月光——","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"哦，对不起，您身上闪烁的不是月光，是我们上周安的探照灯。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkwine_generous","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":19},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkwine_generous","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":21},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkwine_generous","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"（畅快的饮酒声）","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"……","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"让你别喝这么多，你还记得我们今晚是来参加投票的吗？一会儿刻陶片的时候，可别伤了自己的手。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2072_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"当然记得，我是来为缇缇小姐投票的！","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"昨天我一个人在神殿内厅摆弄雕像的时候差点摔倒，要不是缇缇小姐用她的源石技艺帮了我，我现在哪还能喝到酒呀。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"呃……","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2072_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"multiline","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"你是不是不信？","id":34},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":36},{"type":"multiline","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"我给你演示一下，当时我被雕像拖到地面的衣带绊倒，然后——","id":37},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":38},{"type":"multiline","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"哎哟！","id":39},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":42},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"小心！","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"几条柔软洁白的布带从暗处伸出，像有意识般地向醉酒女孩飞去，帮她稳住重心。","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"确认对方无碍后，它们松了劲头，抚过女孩被意外弄乱的头发，责怪地拍打着丰蹄女孩的双角。","id":46},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2072_1#1$2","posfrom":"-200,-30","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2072_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"看到没？然后我就被另一些衣带救了，是不是很神奇！","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"欸？缇缇小姐你怎么来了，一起喝酒呀。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"charslot","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"帕拉斯曾告诉我，搬运队里有个女孩爱喝酒，个子小但是力气大，就是很容易摔跤。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"只是没想到短短三天，我就看你摔了不下十次，坎提亚。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2072_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的工匠","text":"谢谢你，缇缇小姐。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2072_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"她的酒量就是米诺斯人的平均水平，不能多喝。原本米诺斯人喝酒就是小酌怡情，哪知道她长了颗老酒鬼的心。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"哈哈……","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"倒是你，缇缇小姐，需不需要来一杯？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我看上去……是不是很紧张？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"脸上看不出，但这几天相处下来，工程队的大家都知道，这位菲林小姐的尾巴藏不住心事。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"唔……","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"缇缇小姐，脚手架下那个灰尾巴上戴叶子饰环的是谁？","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"萨瑞芬，粉刷组的，只有跟身材健壮的粉刷工分在一起才会有干劲，他说自己只是爱偷懒，所有人都不信。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"那蹲在角落里不跟任何人打招呼的埃拉菲亚呢？","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"莱夫特瑞斯，雕刻组的，只有在太阳照不到的地方才能找到她。我跟她也就聊过几句，但我知道她对自己的作品一心一意。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"大部分工匠到现在为止甚至都不知道莱夫的存在，而你对她的了解已经不少了。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"缇缇小姐，我不知道别人会如何评价你和你的身份，但对我而言，你就是我们中的一员。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"……！","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"谢谢你，马诺斯。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_bg_69_g11_firsttemple_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#7$1","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"不去安慰你的朋友吗？她看上去有些紧张。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"体恤人心是你的专长，恩底弥翁神殿的卡珊卓拉小姐。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"缇缇现在需要的不是一个朋友的安慰，而是亲身参与神殿建设的米诺斯人的支持。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"在那两位好心的工匠跟她搭话之前，梅捷缇克缇小姐一直在默诵一会儿的演讲词。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"一旦舌头打结了，她就会不由自主地抓住自己的尾巴，有两次还误揪了身边那只小宠物的皮毛，惹得它很不高兴。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"观察得这么仔细？看来你也挺喜欢缇缇的嘛。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"……","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"仅凭这些，还不足以证明她是值得信任的人。我只是不想因为偏见，放弃用自己的眼睛进行确认的权利。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"你早就认定她是神殿建设负责人的最佳人选，我会尊重你的眼光。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"今天晚上，克瑞斯拉的双眸中没有迷困之徒的阴影，大家心中都有了自己的决定，无需英雄的代言人开解。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"既然如此，我还有一些个人问题需要处理，就先告辞了。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"你要走？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"明面上主导神殿重建的祭司不参与投票，恐怕会被理事官小姐歪曲成某种示威。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"放心，我的陶片已经在投票箱里了。况且，里底娅小姐要是想找神殿祭司们的过错，根本不需要这么明显的借口。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"交换仪式若是在第一神殿举办，那奉请众英雄的戏剧仪式……","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"我会找里底娅小姐再商量一次，至少让她把选择剧目的权力还给雅赛努斯祭司。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"不过那都是后话了，先祝今晚的投票一切顺利。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_bg_69_g9_templetheater_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":131},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":132,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_mictest","volume":"0.5","channel":"2","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"——如上所述，经由这几日我在此参观的体验，石料的问题解决之后，我认为这座建筑的主体部分已接近完成，可以供游客参观。","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"只要按照计划完成收尾工作，一一验收，几日后就能投入使用。","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"另外，若将交换仪式设置在广场上，所需的工作量也不大。只要腾出空间，再划出一片提供后勤服务的区域即可。","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"建筑的其他部分仍可保持不变，等日后彻底完成再全部开放。","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我将依据施工规划的专业知识和经验，整理出一份可执行的方案。","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"若我当选，那明天开始我会正式跟大家一起，完成这座恢弘的克瑞斯拉第一神殿！","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"……","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":151},{"type":"charslot","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"哎呀，今夜的神殿广场真是盛况空前，看来这位梅捷缇克缇小姐待人足够真诚，也很有讨人喜欢的本事。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"要是她能顺利上任，无论对两国之间的友谊，还是对神殿的收尾工作，都大有好处啊！","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"您想要什么？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"我怎么听不懂理事官小姐的话，我只是应邀来观礼的嘉宾之一呀？","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"科林尼亚的商人之子，在我与萨尔贡大使小姐商谈的过程中恰巧经过，随口提出问题的解决方法，顺利促成了今晚的投票仪式。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"这一切只是因为克瑞斯拉保佑？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"有何不可呢？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"按照传统，受到庇护的米诺斯人还需隔天到神殿拜访祭司，坦陈自己已经领受了英雄的祝福。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"不过，哪怕恩底弥翁神殿离理事官办公室再近，您也不会去找卡珊卓拉祭司的，对吗？","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"……","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"您越界了，佩里安德洛斯祭司。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"你我心知肚明，梅捷缇克缇小姐的上任对您而言不仅是在外交领域锦上添花。您更关注的，与我一样，从来都是米诺斯自己的家事。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"提出您的诉求吧，再精妙的口才也无法在我看到交易条款之前，说服我应允。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"哈哈哈，别着急，雅赛努斯的理事官小姐。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"做商人最讲究的就是诚信。待事情尘埃落定，我自会登门找您做生意的。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"现在还没到时候。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"……","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"charslot","id":185},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_bg_69_g9_templetheater_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"那么，按照我们的传统，请各位在手中的陶片背面刻上“同意”或“反对”。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"然后将陶片背面朝下，放入此处的投票箱中。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"全部投票完毕后，我们将一起来统计最终的投票结果。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"若“同意”超过半数，缇缇……梅捷缇克缇小姐就将负责这座神殿到文物交接仪式完成前的建设工作。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"开始吧。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"……","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":203},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":204},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":205},{"type":"charslot","id":206},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":207},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"subtitle","text":"人们纷纷上前，将手中的陶片放入投票箱中。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":209},{"type":"subtitle","text":"投票箱的设置地点与缇缇所站的广场中心之间有一段距离，但她依然能够看到她在前几日刚认识的朋友们微笑的脸。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":210},{"type":"subtitle","text":"视线相交时，他们会向缇缇点头致意。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":211},{"type":"subtitle","text":"虽然看不到他们手中陶片上刻的字，但缇缇知道他们投出的是哪种票。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":212},{"type":"subtitle","text":"谁能想到呢？她想，竟然能主持一座米诺斯神殿的建造。即使是在玛拉帕夏的时代，这也是一份极为荣耀的工作。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":213},{"type":"subtitle","text":"雅赛努斯人对她展现出了莫大的善意，她又该如何回报？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":214},{"type":"subtitle","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"呵，真滑稽。","id":218},{"type":"dialog","id":219},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"一个突兀的声音打断了缇缇的思绪，也让广场上的嘈杂声瞬间消失。","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"今年真是1100年吗？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"我还以为自己是回到了一百年前，萨尔贡人又来统治我们了。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"l","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"……","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"战争已经结束了，墨格斯。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"对你而言或许如此，但于我，不是。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"萨尔贡的敌人依然会出现在我最黑暗的梦中，让我无法摆脱。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"我也想像你们那样健忘，但是我们的英雄通过梦境告诉我不可以。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"charslot","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"为你解梦的祭司是这样说的？","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":246},{"type":"charslot","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"……","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"不。但那些重复的梦境是英雄对我的指示，只有我才最清楚地知道他们的心意。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"我没法跟一个萨尔贡人有说有笑地共事。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"哪怕所有人都告诉我，那个萨尔贡人做的事是好的，结果也是好的，我依旧无法忍受。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"charslot","id":257},{"type":"image","id":258},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_69_i04.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":259},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_69_i04_1","style":"cg","layer":"1","pfrom":"-150,0","pto":"-150,0","id":260},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_69_i04_2","style":"cg","layer":"2","pfrom":"-482,0","pto":"-482,0","id":261},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_69_i04_3","style":"cg","layer":"3","pfrom":"-220,0","pto":"-220,0","id":262},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_69_i04_4","style":"cg","layer":"4","pfrom":"0,216","pto":"0,216","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":264},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$dignified_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_dignified_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":265,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rapidbreath_female","loop":"true","channel":"1","volume":"0","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"缇缇看到那位米诺斯人从她面前走过，一眼也没有看她。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"经过投票箱时，他随手抛出了陶片。那枚小小的碎片擦着箱子落在地上，转动了几下，最终静止时，朝上的是空无一字的背面。","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"缇缇意识到，他对萨尔贡人的厌恶之深，让他甚至不屑于参与这个环节，刻下反对的意见。","id":271},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"3","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":274},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_69_i04_1","fadetime":"3","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":276},{"type":"text","text":"她像是挨了一记重重的耳光。她的脸颊在燃烧，背上却因为感受到了寒意而战栗。","id":277},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"4","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"周围的一切变得极为遥远，所有的人、所有的声音，都像隔着一层厚厚的膜，显得如此疏离，无法靠近。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"在她身侧的帕拉斯似乎上前了一步，不远处的工匠们也都向她投来了目光，可能是在担心。","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"她想说自己挺好的，没事儿，她作为恶行累累的侵略者——萨尔贡人派来的和平使节，早就做好了遭到羞辱的心理准备。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"更何况那位米诺斯人也没有羞辱她，只是不想与她共事而已。没关系的，谁也不可能招所有人喜欢。","id":284},{"type":"text","text":"她想笑一笑，露出梅捷缇克缇-娜苏图-玛夏耶尔标志性的笑容，那种开朗、无忧无虑的神情曾感染过博物馆中的每一位客人。","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"但她一句也说不出来，一下也笑不出来。","id":286},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"4","id":288},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_69_i04_2","fadetime":"2","id":289},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_69_i04_4","fadetime":"2","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"4.5","id":291},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tinnitus_loop","loop":"true","channel":"2","volume":"0","id":292},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"4","id":293},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_69_i04_3","fadetime":"3","id":294},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"1","fadetime":"3","id":295},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"2","fadetime":"3","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"4.5","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"她脑海中回荡着那位扔下陶片的米诺斯人的话语，想起第一天来到雅赛努斯时，渡口的那位质问她的摆渡人。","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"她与神殿工匠相处的时光并没有作假，他们依旧信任自己。","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"但在茫茫陌生的米诺斯人眼中，她不是异想天开、热爱米诺斯传说的缇缇，而是一个萨尔贡人。","id":300},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"6","id":302},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"6","id":303},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"4","id":304},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_69_i05.png","fadetime":"5","screenadapt":"coverall","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"5.5","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"……","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"人都走了，探照灯都关了，你还要继续缩在这里？那个丰蹄小姑娘和神殿的工匠们好像都很担心你。","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"怎么，你打算让所有人都休息，然后靠你的双手和那些破布带子，连夜把神殿修好给米诺斯人赔罪？","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"……","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"唉，我刚一直在你边上绕圈儿，给你使眼色，你但凡低头看我一眼……你就没觉得哪里不对劲？","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"讨人厌的副使找借口不愿出席投票仪式，撇清关系；那个叫里底娅的理事官明显对你另有所图，你还上赶着往人家的圈套里钻。","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"这下好了，看看你现在，好狼狈哦！","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"……","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"不是吧小丫头，哭了？就这点儿小事，我在万王之王的黄金城——把捧高踩低当作日常杂耍的地方，见过不知道多少次！","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"而且，我猜你也不是在为那些利用你的人难过。","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"接到帕夏任务的时候我就提醒过你，这趟行程必定不会是一次开开心心的出游。","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"那段无法被遗忘的历史、还未从伤痛中恢复的米诺斯人、萨尔贡大使的身份，都会反复提醒你，你要处理的不仅是文物交换这一件事。","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"……","id":319},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":320,"musicid":3},{"type":"text","text":"趾高气扬的生物难得露出关心的表情，试图从衣袖底下辨认出菲林女孩的神情，可惜她头压得太低，无法看清。","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"米奥叹了口气，用脑袋顶了顶缇缇的手，把自己团在女孩身边，示意她抚摸自己。","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"毛茸茸的东西能让人有好心情，你说的。","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"我特别准许你抚摸我的尾巴，发泄式地弄乱我的背毛，或者用它们擦干你的眼泪。","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"……","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"擦眼泪还是算了，我讨厌被弄湿。","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"唉，我怎么就挑中了你这么个又脆弱，又会到处惹麻烦的小东西，还要我来安慰。","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"噗……","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"要是我真的那么脆弱，当初你离开大巴扎的时候，就不会选上我了，对吧？","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"嘿，你还自夸上了。看在你心情不好的分上，只此一次，下不为例。","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"谢谢你，米奥。","id":331},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"charslot","id":335},{"type":"image","id":336},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_bg_69_g9_templetheater_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"all","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":340},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"恢复精神了？","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"嗯。只要有人在陶片上刻了我的名字，就代表他信任我，对我有所期待。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"马诺斯说过，我已经是工匠中的一员了。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"在一个家庭中，人尚且会有讨厌的家人，或者老死不相往来的亲戚，更何况我现在是在一个曾遭受萨尔贡伤害的国度。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我无法像传说中的米诺斯英雄一样，用一曲音乐、一首长诗、一番说辞，奇迹般地解决所有问题。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我能做的就是让这座克瑞斯拉第一神殿尽快完工，把早该归还的、属于米诺斯的东西，重新交回他们手里，交回克瑞斯拉手里。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"月亮照亮克瑞斯拉的脸庞，她仍头顶桂冠，拨弄琴弦，望着无尽的远方。","id":355},{"type":"text","text":"缇缇站在高大的大理石雕像下，与克瑞斯拉沐浴着同一片寂静的月光，她闭上眼睛，许下了一个愿望。","id":356},{"type":"dialog","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"image","id":361}],"characters":["醉酒的工匠","清醒的工匠","？？？","缇缇","卡珊卓拉","帕拉斯","里底娅","佩里安德洛斯","颓丧的男人","米奥"]}